msgid ""
"Hold it in your hand, then leftclick to eat it. But why would you want to do "
"this?"
msgstr "把它拿在手上，然后左键点击来食用它。但你为什么要这么做呢？"

#: mods/HELP/doc_items/init.lua:15
msgid ""
"This block's rotation is affected by the way you place it: Place it on the "
"floor or ceiling for a vertical orientation; place it at the side for a "
"horizontal orientation. Sneaking while placing it leads to a perpendicular "
"orientation instead."
msgstr ""
"这个方块的旋转方向受放置方式的影响：将其放置在地板或天花板上时，呈现垂直方"
"向；放置在侧面时，则呈现水平方向。放置时按下潜行键（悄悄移动键）的话，它会呈"
"现垂直方向（与常规垂直方向不同的一种垂直状态，通常是与之相垂直的情况）。"

